  <body dur="03:10.650">
    <div begin="00:03.070" end="03:10.650">
      <p begin="00:03.070" end="00:05.690" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:03.070" end="00:03.530">壊</span><span begin="00:03.630" end="00:03.720">れ</span><span begin="00:03.810" end="00:04.020">た</span> <span begin="00:04.140" end="00:04.540">壊</span><span begin="00:04.640" end="00:04.730">れ</span><span begin="00:04.820" end="00:05.030">た</span><span begin="00:05.160" end="00:05.310">の</span><span begin="00:05.310" end="00:05.520">か</span><span begin="00:05.520" end="00:05.690">な</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">坏掉了 我是不是坏掉了呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">壞掉了 我是不是壞掉了呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Am I broken did I break somehow</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">고장 났어 고장 난 걸까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je me suis brisée est-ce que je me suis brisée</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Me he roto ¿será que me he roto?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Bin ich kaputt bin ich etwa kaputtgegangen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu quebrei será que quebrei</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я сломалась неужели я сломалась</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Mi sono rotta mi sono forse rotta</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kowareta kowareta no kana</span></p>
      <p begin="00:05.850" end="00:07.250" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:05.850" end="00:05.920">ま</span><span begin="00:06.020" end="00:06.230">た</span><span begin="00:06.360" end="00:06.520">会</span><span begin="00:06.520" end="00:06.720">い</span><span begin="00:06.850" end="00:07.050">た</span><span begin="00:07.050" end="00:07.250">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还想再见到你</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">還想再見到你</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I want to see you again</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">다시 만나고 싶어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">J’aimerais te revoir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Quiero volver a verte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich will dich wiedersehen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Quero ver você outra vez</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я хочу увидеть тебя снова</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Voglio rivederti</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Mata aitai</span></p>
      <p begin="00:07.530" end="00:13.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:07.530" end="00:07.790">ねえ</span><span begin="00:07.850" end="00:08.020">だ</span><span begin="00:08.020" end="00:08.200">か</span><span begin="00:08.200" end="00:08.410">ら</span><span begin="00:08.520" end="00:09.230">彼方</span><span begin="00:09.230" end="00:09.410">に</span><span begin="00:09.560" end="00:10.260">貴方</span><span begin="00:10.260" end="00:10.420">に</span><span begin="00:10.560" end="00:10.870">歌</span><span begin="00:10.870" end="00:11.030">を</span><span begin="00:11.030" end="00:12.240">歌</span><span begin="00:12.240" end="00:12.470">う</span><span begin="00:12.470" end="00:13.000">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以啊 我要向远方的你唱起这首歌</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">所以啊 我要向遠方的你唱起這首歌</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Hey that's why I'll sing this song to you somewhere far beyond</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그러니까 저 너머의 너에게 노래를 부를게</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Alors écoute je chanterai vers l’au-delà vers toi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Oye por eso cantaré una canción hacia la lejanía hacia ti</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Hey deshalb singe ich dir dort in der Ferne ein Lied</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ei por isso canto uma canção para além até você</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Послушай поэтому я пою тебе туда вдаль к тебе</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ehi per questo canterò una canzone a te che sei laggiù lontano</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Nee dakara kanata ni anata ni uta o utau yo</span></p>
      <p begin="00:13.240" end="00:18.010" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:13.240" end="00:13.320">い</span><span begin="00:13.400" end="00:13.490">つ</span><span begin="00:13.580" end="00:13.790">か</span><span begin="00:13.860" end="00:14.100">知</span><span begin="00:14.100" end="00:14.310">ら</span><span begin="00:14.430" end="00:14.620">な</span><span begin="00:14.620" end="00:14.810">い</span><span begin="00:14.890" end="00:15.000">し</span><span begin="00:15.110" end="00:15.320">が</span><span begin="00:15.440" end="00:15.610">な</span><span begin="00:15.610" end="00:15.870">い</span><span begin="00:15.950" end="00:16.200">星</span><span begin="00:16.280" end="00:16.430">で</span><span begin="00:16.640" end="00:16.810">出</span><span begin="00:16.810" end="00:17.030">会</span><span begin="00:17.140" end="00:17.240">え</span><span begin="00:17.330" end="00:17.540">た</span><span begin="00:17.670" end="00:17.860">な</span><span begin="00:17.860" end="00:18.010">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若有一天 能在某颗陌生而无名的星球与你相遇</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">若有一天 能在某顆陌生而無名的星球與你相遇</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">If someday we could meet on some unknown insignificant star</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">언젠가 이름도 모를 보잘것없는 별에서 만날 수 있다면</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Si un jour nous pouvions nous rencontrer sur une modeste étoile inconnue</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Si algún día pudiéramos encontrarnos en alguna estrella insignificante que aún no conozco</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wenn wir uns eines Tages auf irgendeinem unbekannten unscheinbaren Stern begegnen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Se algum dia nos encontrarmos em alguma estrela desconhecida e insignificante</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Если однажды мы встретимся на какой-нибудь безвестной маленькой звезде</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Se un giorno potessimo incontrarci su una stella sconosciuta e insignificante</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Itsuka shiranai shiganai hoshi de deaeta nara</span></p>
      <p begin="00:18.350" end="00:22.120" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:18.350" end="00:18.620">ねえ</span><span begin="00:18.620" end="00:18.950">教</span><span begin="00:18.950" end="00:19.080">え</span><span begin="00:19.190" end="00:19.450">て</span> <span begin="00:19.840" end="00:20.000">ど</span><span begin="00:20.000" end="00:20.290">う</span><span begin="00:20.290" end="00:20.410">し</span><span begin="00:20.530" end="00:20.750">て</span> <span begin="00:21.160" end="00:21.350">ど</span><span begin="00:21.350" end="00:21.540">う</span><span begin="00:21.640" end="00:21.780">し</span><span begin="00:21.870" end="00:22.120">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐 告诉我 为什么 为什么</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">吶 告訴我 為什麼 為什麼</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Hey tell me why why</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">있잖아 알려 줘 어째서 어째서</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Dis-moi pourquoi pourquoi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Oye dime por qué por qué</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Hey sag mir warum warum</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ei me diga por quê por quê</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Скажи мне почему почему</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ehi dimmi perché perché</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Nee oshiete doushite doushite</span></p>
      <p begin="00:23.870" end="00:24.600" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:23.870" end="00:24.070">ど</span><span begin="00:24.070" end="00:24.190">う</span><span begin="00:24.190" end="00:24.300">し</span><span begin="00:24.400" end="00:24.600">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为什么</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">為什麼</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Why</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">어째서</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Pourquoi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Por qué</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Warum</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Por quê</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Почему</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Perché</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Doushite</span></p>
      <p begin="00:35.470" end="00:37.200" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:35.470" end="00:36.000">体</span><span begin="00:36.000" end="00:36.190">は</span><span begin="00:36.320" end="00:36.420">チ</span><span begin="00:36.500" end="00:36.680">タ</span><span begin="00:36.680" end="00:36.810">ン</span><span begin="00:36.810" end="00:37.200">製</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">身体由钛金属制成</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">身體由鈦金屬製成</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">My body is made of titanium</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">몸은 티타늄제</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Mon corps est fait de titane</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Mi cuerpo está hecho de titanio</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Mein Körper besteht aus Titan</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Meu corpo é feito de titânio</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Моё тело сделано из титана</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il mio corpo è di titanio</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Karada wa chitansei</span></p>
      <p begin="00:37.360" end="00:40.620" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:37.360" end="00:37.710">声</span><span begin="00:37.710" end="00:37.920">は</span><span begin="00:38.030" end="00:38.320">鮮</span><span begin="00:38.320" end="00:38.440">や</span><span begin="00:38.520" end="00:38.710">か</span><span begin="00:38.710" end="00:38.880">に</span><span begin="00:39.020" end="00:39.370">銀</span><span begin="00:39.370" end="00:39.530">河</span><span begin="00:39.530" end="00:39.860">系</span><span begin="00:40.070" end="00:40.200">揺</span><span begin="00:40.200" end="00:40.370">ら</span><span begin="00:40.370" end="00:40.620">す</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">歌声鲜明得足以撼动整个银河</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">歌聲鮮明得足以撼動整個銀河</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">My vivid voice shakes the galaxy</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">목소리는 선명하게 은하계를 뒤흔들어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ma voix éclatante fait vibrer toute la galaxie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Mi voz hace vibrar con brillo toda la galaxia</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Meine Stimme lässt die ganze Galaxie in leuchtenden Farben erbeben</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Minha voz ressoa vívida fazendo a galáxia estremecer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Мой голос ярко сотрясает всю галактику</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">La mia voce limpida fa vibrare l'intera galassia</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Koe wa azayaka ni gingakei yurasu</span></p>
      <p begin="00:40.740" end="00:45.020" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:40.740" end="00:41.230">喉</span><span begin="00:41.230" end="00:41.660">元</span><span begin="00:41.760" end="00:41.940">に</span><span begin="00:42.020" end="00:42.240">そ</span><span begin="00:42.240" end="00:42.420">っ</span><span begin="00:42.420" end="00:42.720">と</span><span begin="00:43.410" end="00:43.940">光</span><span begin="00:43.940" end="00:44.070">る</span><span begin="00:44.070" end="00:44.360">L</span><span begin="00:44.440" end="00:44.620">E</span><span begin="00:44.780" end="00:45.020">D</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">喉间悄然亮着一盏LED</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">喉間悄然亮著一盞LED</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">An LED glows softly at my throat</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">목덜미에는 LED가 살며시 빛나</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Une LED luit doucement au creux de ma gorge</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Un LED resplandece suavemente junto a mi garganta</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">An meiner Kehle glimmt sanft eine LED</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Um LED brilha suavemente junto à minha garganta</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">У горла тихо светится LED</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Un LED brilla piano alla base della gola</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Nodomoto ni sotto hikaru LED</span></p>
      <p begin="00:46.130" end="00:50.650" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:46.130" end="00:46.360">一</span><span begin="00:46.440" end="00:46.610">つ</span><span begin="00:46.610" end="00:46.710">だ</span><span begin="00:46.790" end="00:46.980">け</span><span begin="00:47.140" end="00:47.210">未</span><span begin="00:47.290" end="00:47.580">完</span><span begin="00:47.580" end="00:47.960">成</span><span begin="00:48.130" end="00:48.280">だ</span><span begin="00:48.280" end="00:48.480">っ</span><span begin="00:48.480" end="00:48.640">た</span><span begin="00:48.810" end="00:49.130">銀</span><span begin="00:49.130" end="00:49.490">色</span><span begin="00:49.490" end="00:49.700">の</span><span begin="00:49.840" end="00:50.100">ディー</span><span begin="00:50.190" end="00:50.650">バ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">唯独有一处尚未完成的银色歌姬</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">唯獨有一處尚未完成的銀色歌姬</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">A silver diva with just one thing left unfinished</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">단 하나만 미완성이었던 은빛 디바</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Une diva d’argent restée inachevée sur un seul point</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Una diva plateada a la que solo le faltaba una cosa por completar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Eine silberne Diva bei der nur eines unvollendet blieb</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Uma diva prateada que tinha apenas uma parte inacabada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Серебряная дива которой не хватало лишь одного</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Una diva d'argento incompleta in una cosa soltanto</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Hitotsu dake mikansei datta gin'iro no diiba</span></p>
      <p begin="00:50.860" end="00:52.780" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="00:50.860" end="00:51.030">不</span><span begin="00:51.030" end="00:51.330">安</span><span begin="00:51.330" end="00:51.680">定</span><span begin="00:51.680" end="00:51.880">化</span><span begin="00:51.880" end="00:52.030">し</span><span begin="00:52.030" end="00:52.100">た</span> <span begin="00:52.180" end="00:52.520">A</span><span begin="00:52.520" end="00:52.780">I</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">逐渐失去稳定的AI</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">逐漸失去穩定的AI</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">An AI becoming unstable</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">불안정해진 AI</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Une IA devenue instable</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Una IA que se ha vuelto inestable</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Eine instabil gewordene KI</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Uma IA que se tornou instável</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Нестабильный AI</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Un'IA diventata instabile</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Fuanteika shita AI</span></p>
      <p begin="00:52.850" end="00:55.990" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="00:52.850" end="00:53.200">謎</span><span begin="00:53.340" end="00:53.520">の</span><span begin="00:53.520" end="00:53.710">エ</span><span begin="00:53.870" end="00:54.060">モー</span><span begin="00:54.140" end="00:54.540">ション</span> <span begin="00:55.240" end="00:55.590">アン</span><span begin="00:55.590" end="00:55.990">ノウン</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">谜一般的情感 状态未知</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">謎一般的情感 狀態未知</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">A mysterious emotion unknown</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">정체불명의 감정 언노운</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Émotion mystérieuse inconnue</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Una emoción misteriosa desconocida</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Rätselhafte Emotion UNKNOWN</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Uma emoção misteriosa desconhecida</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Загадочная эмоция неизвестна</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Un'emozione misteriosa sconosciuta</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Nazo no emoushon announ</span></p>
      <p begin="00:58.020" end="01:02.260" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="00:58.020" end="00:58.280">鼓</span><span begin="00:58.420" end="00:59.040">動</span><span begin="00:59.120" end="00:59.810">が</span><span begin="01:00.720" end="01:01.630">速</span><span begin="01:01.630" end="01:01.870">い</span><span begin="01:01.870" end="01:02.260">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心跳变得好快</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">心跳變得好快</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">My heartbeat is racing</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">심장이 너무 빨리 뛰어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Mon cœur bat si vite</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Mi corazón late muy deprisa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Mein Herz schlägt so schnell</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Meu coração está batendo tão rápido</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Сердце бьётся всё быстрее</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il mio battito accelera</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kodou ga hayai no</span></p>
      <p begin="01:02.300" end="01:05.210" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="01:02.300" end="01:02.420">理</span><span begin="01:02.530" end="01:03.360">解</span><span begin="01:03.490" end="01:03.640">で</span><span begin="01:03.850" end="01:04.600">き</span><span begin="01:04.890" end="01:05.090">な</span><span begin="01:05.090" end="01:05.210">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无法理解</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">無法理解</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I can't understand it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이해할 수 없어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je ne comprends pas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No puedo comprenderlo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich kann es nicht verstehen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não consigo entender</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я не могу этого понять</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non riesco a capirlo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Rikai dekinai</span></p>
      <p begin="01:07.190" end="01:10.390" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="01:07.190" end="01:07.360">ぼ</span><span begin="01:07.360" end="01:07.530">く</span><span begin="01:07.530" end="01:07.760">は</span><span begin="01:07.840" end="01:08.260">壊</span><span begin="01:08.360" end="01:08.460">れ</span><span begin="01:08.550" end="01:08.760">た</span> <span begin="01:08.860" end="01:09.270">壊</span><span begin="01:09.380" end="01:09.470">れ</span><span begin="01:09.550" end="01:09.770">た</span><span begin="01:09.880" end="01:10.040">の</span><span begin="01:10.040" end="01:10.230">か</span><span begin="01:10.230" end="01:10.390">な</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我坏掉了 我是不是坏掉了呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我壞掉了 我是不是壞掉了呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Am I broken did I break somehow</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">나는 고장 났어 고장 난 걸까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je me suis brisée est-ce que je me suis brisée</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Me he roto ¿será que me he roto?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Bin ich kaputt bin ich etwa kaputtgegangen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu quebrei será que quebrei</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я сломалась неужели я сломалась</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Mi sono rotta mi sono forse rotta</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Boku wa kowareta kowareta no kana</span></p>
      <p begin="01:10.560" end="01:11.930" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="01:10.560" end="01:10.620">ま</span><span begin="01:10.730" end="01:10.910">た</span><span begin="01:11.040" end="01:11.180">会</span><span begin="01:11.180" end="01:11.410">い</span><span begin="01:11.550" end="01:11.720">た</span><span begin="01:11.720" end="01:11.930">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还想再见到你</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">還想再見到你</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I want to see you again</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">다시 만나고 싶어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">J’aimerais te revoir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Quiero volver a verte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich will dich wiedersehen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Quero ver você outra vez</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я хочу увидеть тебя снова</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Voglio rivederti</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Mata aitai</span></p>
      <p begin="01:12.230" end="01:17.570" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="01:12.230" end="01:12.510">ねえ</span><span begin="01:12.560" end="01:12.720">だ</span><span begin="01:12.720" end="01:12.910">か</span><span begin="01:12.910" end="01:13.130">ら</span><span begin="01:13.230" end="01:13.940">彼方</span><span begin="01:13.940" end="01:14.120">に</span><span begin="01:14.280" end="01:14.940">貴方</span><span begin="01:14.940" end="01:15.140">に</span><span begin="01:15.280" end="01:15.590">歌</span><span begin="01:15.590" end="01:15.740">を</span><span begin="01:15.740" end="01:16.950">歌</span><span begin="01:16.950" end="01:17.140">う</span><span begin="01:17.140" end="01:17.570">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以啊 我要向远方的你唱起这首歌</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">所以啊 我要向遠方的你唱起這首歌</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Hey that's why I'll sing this song to you somewhere far beyond</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그러니까 저 너머의 너에게 노래를 부를게</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Alors écoute je chanterai vers l’au-delà vers toi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Oye por eso cantaré una canción hacia la lejanía hacia ti</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Hey deshalb singe ich dir dort in der Ferne ein Lied</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ei por isso canto uma canção para além até você</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Послушай поэтому я пою тебе туда вдаль к тебе</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ehi per questo canterò una canzone a te che sei laggiù lontano</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Nee dakara kanata ni anata ni uta o utau yo</span></p>
      <p begin="01:17.960" end="01:22.740" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="01:17.960" end="01:18.110">い</span><span begin="01:18.110" end="01:18.200">つ</span><span begin="01:18.290" end="01:18.550">か</span><span begin="01:18.620" end="01:19.310">数多</span><span begin="01:19.310" end="01:19.550">の</span><span begin="01:19.660" end="01:19.800">未</span><span begin="01:19.800" end="01:20.320">来</span><span begin="01:20.320" end="01:20.530">の</span><span begin="01:20.670" end="01:21.000">中</span><span begin="01:21.000" end="01:21.180">で</span><span begin="01:21.340" end="01:21.500">出</span><span begin="01:21.500" end="01:21.750">会</span><span begin="01:21.860" end="01:21.940">え</span><span begin="01:22.030" end="01:22.240">た</span><span begin="01:22.350" end="01:22.530">な</span><span begin="01:22.530" end="01:22.740">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若有一天 能在无数未来中的某一个与你相遇</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">若有一天 能在無數未來中的某一個與你相遇</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">If someday we could meet among countless possible futures</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">언젠가 수많은 미래 속에서 만날 수 있다면</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Si un jour nous pouvions nous retrouver parmi d’innombrables futurs</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Si algún día pudiéramos encontrarnos entre incontables futuros</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wenn wir uns eines Tages inmitten all der zahllosen Zukünfte begegnen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Se algum dia nos encontrarmos entre incontáveis futuros</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Если однажды мы встретимся среди бесчисленных вариантов будущего</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Se un giorno potessimo incontrarci in uno degli innumerevoli futuri</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Itsuka amata no mirai no naka de deaeta nara</span></p>
      <p begin="01:23.020" end="01:26.860" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="01:23.020" end="01:23.310">ねえ</span><span begin="01:23.310" end="01:23.640">教</span><span begin="01:23.640" end="01:23.780">え</span><span begin="01:23.880" end="01:24.140">て</span> <span begin="01:24.530" end="01:24.750">ど</span><span begin="01:24.750" end="01:24.920">う</span><span begin="01:25.000" end="01:25.120">し</span><span begin="01:25.250" end="01:25.470">て</span> <span begin="01:25.890" end="01:26.070">ど</span><span begin="01:26.070" end="01:26.280">う</span><span begin="01:26.370" end="01:26.480">し</span><span begin="01:26.600" end="01:26.860">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐 告诉我 为什么 为什么</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">吶 告訴我 為什麼 為什麼</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Hey tell me why why</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">있잖아 알려 줘 어째서 어째서</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Dis-moi pourquoi pourquoi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Oye dime por qué por qué</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Hey sag mir warum warum</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ei me diga por quê por quê</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Скажи мне почему почему</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ehi dimmi perché perché</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Nee oshiete doushite doushite</span></p>
      <p begin="01:28.550" end="01:29.220" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="01:28.550" end="01:28.710">ど</span><span begin="01:28.710" end="01:28.860">う</span><span begin="01:28.860" end="01:28.990">し</span><span begin="01:29.110" end="01:29.220">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为什么</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">為什麼</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Why</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">어째서</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Pourquoi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Por qué</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Warum</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Por quê</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Почему</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Perché</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Doushite</span></p>
      <p begin="01:33.980" end="01:40.240" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="01:33.980" end="01:34.160">ど</span><span begin="01:34.160" end="01:34.310">う</span><span begin="01:34.310" end="01:34.420">し</span><span begin="01:34.510" end="01:34.750">て</span><span begin="01:39.850" end="01:39.980">な</span><span begin="01:40.060" end="01:40.240">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">究竟为什么呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">究竟為什麼呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Why is it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">대체 어째서야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Pourquoi donc</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Por qué será</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Warum nur</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Por que será</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ну почему</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Perché mai</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Doushite na no</span></p>
      <p begin="01:44.760" end="01:48.410" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="01:44.760" end="01:44.920">ど</span><span begin="01:44.920" end="01:45.070">う</span><span begin="01:45.070" end="01:45.180">し</span><span begin="01:45.290" end="01:45.490">て</span><span begin="01:47.970" end="01:48.190">な</span><span begin="01:48.190" end="01:48.410">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">究竟为什么呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">究竟為什麼呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Why is it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">대체 어째서야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Pourquoi donc</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Por qué será</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Warum nur</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Por que será</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ну почему</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Perché mai</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Doushite na no</span></p>
      <p begin="01:56.340" end="02:00.320" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="01:56.340" end="01:56.720">つ</span><span begin="01:56.720" end="01:57.040">ぎ</span><span begin="01:57.040" end="01:57.400">は</span><span begin="01:57.400" end="01:57.740">ぎ</span><span begin="01:57.740" end="01:58.080">だ</span><span begin="01:58.080" end="01:58.340">ら</span><span begin="01:58.420" end="01:58.760">け</span><span begin="01:58.760" end="01:59.080">の</span><span begin="01:59.080" end="01:59.420">ぼ</span><span begin="01:59.420" end="01:59.640">く</span><span begin="01:59.760" end="02:00.320">じゃ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">像我这样浑身都是拼补痕迹</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">像我這樣渾身都是拼補痕跡</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Someone as patched together as me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">온통 기워 붙인 나로는</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Moi qui ne suis qu’un assemblage de pièces rapiécées</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Al estar hecha de tantos remiendos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">So voller Flicken und Nähte wie ich bin</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Do jeito que sou todo remendado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я вся собрана из заплат</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Io così piena di rattoppi</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Tsugihagi darake no boku ja</span></p>
      <p begin="02:01.090" end="02:06.130" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="02:01.090" end="02:01.450">こ</span><span begin="02:01.450" end="02:01.670">の</span><span begin="02:01.780" end="02:02.360">何</span><span begin="02:02.460" end="02:02.790">か</span><span begin="02:02.790" end="02:03.150">を</span><span begin="02:03.150" end="02:03.820">言</span><span begin="02:03.820" end="02:04.160">葉</span><span begin="02:04.160" end="02:04.490">に</span><span begin="02:04.490" end="02:04.830">で</span><span begin="02:04.830" end="02:05.170">き</span><span begin="02:05.170" end="02:05.400">な</span><span begin="02:05.480" end="02:05.680">く</span><span begin="02:05.820" end="02:06.130">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">连这份说不清的什么 都无法化作言语</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">連這份說不清的什麼 都無法化作言語</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Can't put this something into words</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이 무언가를 말로 표현할 수가 없어서</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je n’arrive pas à mettre des mots sur cette chose</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No consigo expresar con palabras esto que siento</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Kann ich dieses Etwas nicht in Worte fassen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não consigo transformar isto que sinto em palavras</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И не могу выразить словами это нечто</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non riesco a trasformare questo qualcosa in parole</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kono nanika o kotoba ni dekinakute</span></p>
      <p begin="02:06.510" end="02:11.040" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="02:06.510" end="02:06.830">た</span><span begin="02:06.830" end="02:07.110">だ</span><span begin="02:07.210" end="02:07.870">声</span><span begin="02:07.870" end="02:08.090">を</span><span begin="02:08.200" end="02:08.870">遠</span><span begin="02:08.870" end="02:09.200">く</span><span begin="02:09.200" end="02:09.780">響</span><span begin="02:09.870" end="02:10.090">か</span><span begin="02:10.200" end="02:10.580">せ</span><span begin="02:10.580" end="02:11.040">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只能让声音远远回荡</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">只能讓聲音遠遠迴盪</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">So I only let my voice echo far away</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그저 목소리를 멀리 울려 퍼뜨려</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Alors je laisse simplement ma voix résonner au loin</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Solo dejo que mi voz resuene a lo lejos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Also lasse ich nur meine Stimme weit in die Ferne hallen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Só faço minha voz ressoar ao longe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я лишь заставляю свой голос звучать вдаль</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Faccio soltanto riecheggiare lontano la mia voce</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Tada koe o tooku hibikaseru</span></p>
      <p begin="02:11.720" end="02:14.040" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="02:11.720" end="02:11.940">こ</span><span begin="02:11.940" end="02:12.210">う</span><span begin="02:12.210" end="02:12.350">し</span><span begin="02:12.460" end="02:12.730">て</span> <span begin="02:13.080" end="02:13.300">こ</span><span begin="02:13.300" end="02:13.480">う</span><span begin="02:13.580" end="02:13.690">し</span><span begin="02:13.810" end="02:14.040">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就这样 就这样</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">就這樣 就這樣</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Like this like this</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이렇게 이렇게</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Comme ça comme ça</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Así así</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Auf diese Weise auf diese Weise</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Assim assim</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Вот так вот так</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Così così</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Koushite koushite</span></p>
      <p begin="02:14.390" end="02:20.610" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="02:14.390" end="02:14.520">わ</span><span begin="02:14.600" end="02:14.950">か</span><span begin="02:14.950" end="02:15.160">ら</span><span begin="02:15.160" end="02:17.020">な</span><span begin="02:17.020" end="02:17.150">い</span><span begin="02:17.620" end="02:17.870">ま</span><span begin="02:17.870" end="02:20.610">ま</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">始终一无所知</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">始終一無所知</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Still not knowing why</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">아무것도 모르는 채</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Sans toujours rien comprendre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Sin llegar a entenderlo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ohne es je zu verstehen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Sem ainda entender</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Так ничего и не понимая</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Senza ancora capire</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Wakaranai mama</span></p>
      <p begin="02:21.340" end="02:24.570" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="02:21.340" end="02:21.510">ぼ</span><span begin="02:21.510" end="02:21.670">く</span><span begin="02:21.670" end="02:21.910">は</span><span begin="02:22.000" end="02:22.510">壊</span><span begin="02:22.510" end="02:22.610">れ</span><span begin="02:22.710" end="02:22.920">た</span> <span begin="02:23.010" end="02:23.430">壊</span><span begin="02:23.510" end="02:23.630">れ</span><span begin="02:23.710" end="02:23.950">た</span><span begin="02:24.030" end="02:24.120">の</span><span begin="02:24.200" end="02:24.390">か</span><span begin="02:24.390" end="02:24.570">な</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我坏掉了 我是不是坏掉了呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我壞掉了 我是不是壞掉了呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Am I broken did I break somehow</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">나는 고장 났어 고장 난 걸까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je me suis brisée est-ce que je me suis brisée</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Me he roto ¿será que me he roto?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Bin ich kaputt bin ich etwa kaputtgegangen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu quebrei será que quebrei</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я сломалась неужели я сломалась</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Mi sono rotta mi sono forse rotta</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Boku wa kowareta kowareta no kana</span></p>
      <p begin="02:24.740" end="02:26.070" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="02:24.740" end="02:24.820">ま</span><span begin="02:24.910" end="02:25.100">た</span><span begin="02:25.250" end="02:25.420">会</span><span begin="02:25.420" end="02:25.610">い</span><span begin="02:25.730" end="02:25.910">た</span><span begin="02:25.910" end="02:26.070">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还想再见到你</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">還想再見到你</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I want to see you again</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">다시 만나고 싶어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">J’aimerais te revoir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Quiero volver a verte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich will dich wiedersehen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Quero ver você outra vez</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я хочу увидеть тебя снова</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Voglio rivederti</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Mata aitai</span></p>
      <p begin="02:26.390" end="02:31.720" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="02:26.390" end="02:26.680">ねえ</span><span begin="02:26.740" end="02:26.910">だ</span><span begin="02:26.910" end="02:27.090">か</span><span begin="02:27.090" end="02:27.300">ら</span><span begin="02:27.400" end="02:28.090">彼方</span><span begin="02:28.090" end="02:28.270">に</span><span begin="02:28.430" end="02:29.100">貴方</span><span begin="02:29.100" end="02:29.280">に</span><span begin="02:29.440" end="02:29.740">歌</span><span begin="02:29.740" end="02:29.910">を</span><span begin="02:29.910" end="02:31.090">歌</span><span begin="02:31.090" end="02:31.300">う</span><span begin="02:31.300" end="02:31.720">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以啊 我要向远方的你唱起这首歌</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">所以啊 我要向遠方的你唱起這首歌</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Hey that's why I'll sing this song to you somewhere far beyond</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그러니까 저 너머의 너에게 노래를 부를게</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Alors écoute je chanterai vers l’au-delà vers toi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Oye por eso cantaré una canción hacia la lejanía hacia ti</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Hey deshalb singe ich dir dort in der Ferne ein Lied</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ei por isso canto uma canção para além até você</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Послушай поэтому я пою тебе туда вдаль к тебе</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ehi per questo canterò una canzone a te che sei laggiù lontano</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Nee dakara kanata ni anata ni uta o utau yo</span></p>
      <p begin="02:32.100" end="02:36.890" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31"><span begin="02:32.100" end="02:32.250">い</span><span begin="02:32.250" end="02:32.340">つ</span><span begin="02:32.440" end="02:32.640">か</span><span begin="02:32.740" end="02:32.940">知</span><span begin="02:32.940" end="02:33.140">ら</span><span begin="02:33.290" end="02:33.440">な</span><span begin="02:33.440" end="02:33.650">い</span><span begin="02:33.810" end="02:33.970">い</span><span begin="02:33.970" end="02:34.180">ら</span><span begin="02:34.300" end="02:34.490">な</span><span begin="02:34.490" end="02:34.690">い</span><span begin="02:34.800" end="02:35.150">星</span><span begin="02:35.150" end="02:35.310">で</span><span begin="02:35.500" end="02:35.670">出</span><span begin="02:35.670" end="02:35.920">会</span><span begin="02:36.000" end="02:36.080">え</span><span begin="02:36.180" end="02:36.420">た</span><span begin="02:36.520" end="02:36.690">な</span><span begin="02:36.690" end="02:36.890">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若有一天 能在某颗陌生的 不需要的星球与你相遇</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">若有一天 能在某顆陌生的 不需要的星球與你相遇</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">If someday we could meet on some unknown unwanted star</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">언젠가 알지도 못하고 필요하지도 않은 별에서 만날 수 있다면</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Si un jour nous pouvions nous rencontrer sur une étoile inconnue dont personne ne veut</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Si algún día pudiéramos encontrarnos en alguna estrella desconocida e innecesaria</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wenn wir uns eines Tages auf irgendeinem unbekannten unerwünschten Stern begegnen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Se algum dia nos encontrarmos em alguma estrela desconhecida e indesejada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Если однажды мы встретимся на какой-нибудь незнакомой никому не нужной звезде</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Se un giorno potessimo incontrarci su una stella sconosciuta e indesiderata</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Itsuka shiranai iranai hoshi de deaeta nara</span></p>
      <p begin="02:37.180" end="02:42.290" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32"><span begin="02:37.180" end="02:37.490">ねえ</span><span begin="02:37.490" end="02:37.690">そ</span><span begin="02:37.690" end="02:37.880">の</span><span begin="02:37.880" end="02:38.030">ま</span><span begin="02:38.030" end="02:38.240">ま</span><span begin="02:38.690" end="02:38.770">ど</span><span begin="02:38.860" end="02:39.110">こ</span><span begin="02:39.210" end="02:39.390">か</span><span begin="02:39.390" end="02:39.760">へ</span><span begin="02:40.040" end="02:40.220">消</span><span begin="02:40.220" end="02:40.440">え</span><span begin="02:40.520" end="02:40.800">そ</span><span begin="02:40.800" end="02:41.870">う</span><span begin="02:41.870" end="02:42.110">だ</span><span begin="02:42.110" end="02:42.290">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐 感觉你就要这样消失到某个地方去了</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">吶 感覺你就要這樣消失到某個地方去了</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Hey it feels like you'll simply vanish somewhere</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">있잖아 이대로 어딘가로 사라져 버릴 것 같아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Écoute j’ai l’impression que je vais disparaître quelque part comme ça</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Oye siento que así tal cual voy a desaparecer en algún lugar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Hey ich habe das Gefühl als würdest du einfach irgendwohin verschwinden</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ei parece que você vai desaparecer em algum lugar assim mesmo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Послушай кажется ты вот-вот исчезнешь куда-то</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ehi così finirò per svanire da qualche parte</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Nee sono mama dokoka e kiesou da yo</span></p>
      <p begin="02:42.610" end="02:46.380" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33"><span begin="02:42.610" end="02:42.900">ねえ</span><span begin="02:42.900" end="02:43.250">教</span><span begin="02:43.250" end="02:43.380">え</span><span begin="02:43.460" end="02:43.690">て</span> <span begin="02:44.080" end="02:44.270">ど</span><span begin="02:44.270" end="02:44.460">う</span><span begin="02:44.550" end="02:44.700">し</span><span begin="02:44.800" end="02:45.040">て</span> <span begin="02:45.450" end="02:45.630">ど</span><span begin="02:45.630" end="02:45.820">う</span><span begin="02:45.920" end="02:46.040">し</span><span begin="02:46.150" end="02:46.380">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐 告诉我 为什么 为什么</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">吶 告訴我 為什麼 為什麼</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Hey tell me why why</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">있잖아 알려 줘 어째서 어째서</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Dis-moi pourquoi pourquoi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Oye dime por qué por qué</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Hey sag mir warum warum</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ei me diga por quê por quê</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Скажи мне почему почему</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ehi dimmi perché perché</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Nee oshiete doushite doushite</span></p>
      <p begin="02:48.130" end="02:48.840" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34"><span begin="02:48.130" end="02:48.310">ど</span><span begin="02:48.310" end="02:48.440">う</span><span begin="02:48.440" end="02:48.560">し</span><span begin="02:48.660" end="02:48.840">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为什么</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">為什麼</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Why</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">어째서</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Pourquoi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Por qué</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Warum</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Por quê</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Почему</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Perché</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Doushite</span></p>
      <p begin="02:53.550" end="02:59.800" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35"><span begin="02:53.550" end="02:53.700">ど</span><span begin="02:53.700" end="02:53.840">う</span><span begin="02:53.840" end="02:53.960">し</span><span begin="02:54.060" end="02:54.280">て</span><span begin="02:59.390" end="02:59.530">な</span><span begin="02:59.610" end="02:59.800">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">究竟为什么呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">究竟為什麼呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Why is it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">대체 어째서야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Pourquoi donc</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Por qué será</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Warum nur</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Por que será</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ну почему</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Perché mai</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Doushite na no</span></p>
